Rust helper (macOS app only)

The helper embedded in the macOS app is built from Helper/CodexexHelper. It includes:

- 39 crates from openai/codex at commit be6e8eac029b183056b7e4402879f15d2c85f61b
  (version 0.147.0), including codex-protocol, codex-backend-client, codex-client and
  codex-login — Apache License, Version 2.0
  (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
- tokio-tungstenite 0.28.0 (MIT) and tungstenite 0.27.0 (MIT OR Apache-2.0), from the
  openai-oss-forks repositories.
- 567 further Rust crates, including tokio, reqwest, rustls, serde and chrono, under MIT,
  Apache-2.0, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, ISC, Zlib, Unicode-3.0, CDLA-Permissive-2.0
  and other permissive licences, and one crate under MPL-2.0 (below), as listed in
  docs/legal/third-party-notices.md.
- The Rust standard library — Apache-2.0 OR MIT.

